@title Closed-loop winch: the motor's property sheet shows the Closed-loop winch section with its rows
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768
# Lane L2c. Selecting the winch motor shows the "Closed-loop winch" section of the property sheet:
# hook load, drum, gearbox, motor plate, encoder, brake and the drawing devices it is wired to.
open qa/fixtures/closed-winch.novo
wait 30
key Escape
wait 5
key Home
wait 30
click 377 229
wait 30
shot motor-selected
expect "Hook load (payload and block)"
scroll 1130 500 -600
wait 20
shot numbers-rows
scroll 1130 500 -900
wait 20
expect "Up command device"
shot devices-rows
check_layout
